00:00:08.608 --> 00:00:11.578
-The idea of the game is --
you have a furious five seconds

00:00:11.578 --> 00:00:15.014
to go -- to find five items.

00:00:15.014 --> 00:00:16.349
And you have five seconds each.

00:00:16.349 --> 00:00:19.752
So, you know, and
you have to go find an item,

00:00:19.752 --> 00:00:22.388
whatever item
I name in five seconds.

00:00:22.388 --> 00:00:24.557
You know what I'm saying?
-This is tough.

00:00:24.557 --> 00:00:25.825
-Huh?

00:00:25.825 --> 00:00:26.926
