all of my stuff left.

00:00:31.765 --> 00:00:35.268
-[ Laughs ] Yeah.
-All my stuff is gone.

00:00:35.268 --> 00:00:36.469
-Yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:00:36.469 --> 00:00:38.604
Your stuff -- it starts
disappearing, right?

00:00:38.604 --> 00:00:39.939
-Yeah. I don't see it anymore.

00:00:39.939 --> 00:00:42.375
But I'm in, like,
kind of a work room,

00:00:42.375 --> 00:00:46.445
so I can find things that if
you give me something,

00:00:46.445 --> 00:00:48.448
I can find something.

00:00:48.448 --> 00:00:50.083
-Alright.

00:00:50.083 --> 00:00:54.521
Okay, I'll give you a
furious five seconds

00:00:54.521 --> 00:00:58.858
to find a dog chew toy --
1,000 points.

00:00:58.858 --> 00:01:01.427
-A dog -- A chew toy?
-Yeah, a chew toy.

00:01:01.427 --> 00:01:04.563
1,001, 1,002...
-Aah!

00:01:04.563 --> 00:01:06.032
-...1,003,

00:01:06.032 --> 00:01:08.734
1,004, 1,005,

00:01:08.734 --> 00:01:09.903
